{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:d0c2f0ae1f6a1f5d","name":"Bothan","source":{"id":"source:reference-d0c2f0ae1f6a1f5d","title":"Bothan","revision":16341,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:56:44Z","sha256":"a15203170c4f4faf2d8f39362b55824a7831cbf64b1e2c815e6b8fa5f66aec37","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=16341","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Bothan&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-d0c2f0ae1f6a1f5d","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Native to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bothawui"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bothawui","referenceId":"reference:75082da1d3f8a127"},", these short, fur-covered humanoids have had hyperspace travel for thousands of years. Bothans use information as a measure of wealth and power, even wielding it as a weapon when necessary. ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Bothan SpyNet"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Bothan_SpyNet","referenceId":"reference:e9b378f0f809a67b"},", one of the largest intelligence agencies during most eras, plays an important role in the Galactic Civil War.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Culturally, Bothans don't believe in direct conflict because it destroys people, material, and even information. They prefer behind-the-scenes manipulation, watching and waiting for information that they can use to gain status and influence. This attitude makes espionage a natural part of their culture. While others often find Bothans to be manipulative and irritating, no one wants to lose access to their SpyNet. As a result, nearly all groups have at least some contact with the Bothans.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Bothan Characteristics"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Personality:"]}," Bothans are curious, manipulative, crafty, suspicious, and even a bit paranoid. They can be irritating, but they are also loyal and brave.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Physical Description:"]}," Bothans are covered with fur that ripples in response to their emotional state. They have tapered ears, and both male and female Bothans sport beards. They average about 1.6 meters tall and have a maturity rate and life span slightly greater than ",{"tag":"a","children":["Humans"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Humans"},". The typical Bothan averages at 55 kilograms in weight.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Age Groups"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Age_Groups"},":"]}," Bothans age at the following stages:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["CHILD\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["YOUNG ADULT\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["ADULT\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["MIDDLE AGE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["OLD\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["VENERABLE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1-11 Years\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["12-16 Years\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["17-45 Years\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["46-65 Years\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["66-84 Years\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["85+ Years\n"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Homeworld:"]}," The industrial world of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bothawui"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bothawui","referenceId":"reference:75082da1d3f8a127"}," is the birthplace of the Bothans, along with various colony worlds throughout ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Mid Rim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Mid_Rim?action=edit&redlink=1"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Languages:"]}," Bothans speak, read, and write both Bothese and Basic.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Example Names:"]}," Borsk Fey'lya, Karka Kre'fey, Koth Melan, Tav Breil'lya, Tereb Ab'lon.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Adventurers:"]}," Bothan adventures, often SpyNet operatives, engage in daring missions at great personal risk. In addition, many Bothan heroes serve as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Soldiers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Soldiers"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scoundrels"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scoundrels"},", and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nobles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nobles"},". Their curiosity leads some to be explorers and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scouts"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scouts"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Bothan Species Traits"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Bothans share the following Species Traits:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Ability Modifiers:"]}," All Bothans receive a +2 bonus to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"},", but suffer a -2 penalty to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Constitution"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Constitution"},". Bothans are agile but not particularly resilient."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Medium Size:"]}," As Medium creatures, Bothans have no special bonuses or penalties due to their size."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Speed:"]}," Bothans have a base speed of 6 squares."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Conditional Bonus Feat:"]}," Bothans are natural spies and investigators. A Bothan with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gather Information"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gather_Information","referenceId":"reference:a719fb58321fb08c"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained_Skill"}," gains ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Focus (Gather Information)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Focus_(Gather_Information)"}," as a bonus ",{"tag":"a","children":["Feat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feat"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Iron Will:"]}," Bothans have above-average willpower and gain a +2 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"}," bonus to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Automatic Languages:"]}," All Bothans can speak, read, and write both Basic and Bothese."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Species Feats"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rebellion Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Bothan characters have access to the following ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species Feats"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species_Feats"},". No Species Feats are considered Bonus Feats for any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heroic Class"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heroic_Class"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SPECIES FEAT\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["BENEFITS\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Bothan Will"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bothan_Will","referenceId":"reference:1cf16b31ab9b2f17"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Gain a bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"}," when an enemy fails to overcome your iron will.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Confident Success"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Confident_Success","referenceId":"reference:7c92c3b16026196c"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Gain a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," when you successfully ",{"tag":"a","children":["Learn Secret Information"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Learn_Secret_Information"},".\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Lasting Influence"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lasting_Influence","referenceId":"reference:cf392506dab3f49e"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["After a successful ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," check, gain a bonus to future ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," checks.\n"]}]}]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
